    faq:{title:'Frequently asked questions',items:[['What is included in the 399k Trust Kit?','You receive print-ready Google Review QR standee artwork, a direct Google review link setup, a short public-presence audit, and a checklist for natural review collection. Plus: if you upgrade to Starter within 30 days, the full 399,000 VND is credited toward your balance.'],['Do you need Google Maps edit access?','Absolutely not. Your Google account stays entirely yours. Lumi only uses public place data to generate your review QR and embed directions—no logins or permissions requested.'],['Can I make a website with AI myself?','Yes, you can. Lumi is not priced because coding is rare. You pay for done-for-you execution: authentic copy, mobile optimization, domain/SSL wiring, direct contact buttons, and ongoing maintenance so you never waste weekend hours debugging tech.'],['Do you guarantee Google ranking or customers?','No. We answer frankly: anyone guaranteeing Google ranking or revenue at this price point is selling hype. Lumi guarantees a professional, fast mobile presence so when local customers find you, they trust what they see and reach out immediately.'],['What does renewal cost from year two?','Simple and transparent: 599,000 VND/year with a RunLumi address, or 999,000 VND/year with one standard custom domain (.vn/.com). Both include fast hosting, SSL certificates, and ongoing technical support.'],['Do I have to buy Trust Kit first?','No. If the preview is clear and you want the full bundle, you can get Lumi Local Starter directly.']]},
    form:{eyebrow:'Next step',title:'Show Lumi your business first.',text:'Your name, business name, and phone/Zalo are all we need. Lumi reviews your public context first and sends a custom mobile demo for you to look over.',name:'Your name',business:'Business name',phone:'Phone / Zalo',email:'Email (optional)',note:'What would you like help with? (optional)',consent:'I agree that Lumi may contact me regarding this request.',submit:'Show me Lumi Local for my business',privacy:'No payment or account creation required. Never send banking data or confidential files.',success:'We received your request! We will reach out via Zalo/Phone within 24 hours with your preview.',error:'Could not send the request. Please try again or reach out directly.'},
    footer:'A website is just one component. Lumi Local handles the practical setup, trust assets, and technical maintenance.'
  }
